  "audio_sha256": "a1438fbc5dcb5d678c61e26a499fbfcaafd6c56aa4eb06f1e8a194346443027f",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0121",
      "text": "社会上大多数人都一无所有，他向社会提供棉花和纺锭这些生产资料，还给工人提供生活资料，难道不是作出了巨大贡献？",
      "start_ms": 80,
      "end_ms": 10560,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0122",
      "text": "难道这种服务不该计价吗？",
      "start_ms": 11560,
      "end_ms": 14600,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0123",
      "text": "可是，工人把棉花和纺锭变成纱，不也向他提供了服务吗？",
      "start_ms": 15560,
      "end_ms": 22680,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0124",
      "text": "何况这里讨论的根本不是服务。",
      "start_ms": 23840,
      "end_ms": 26960,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0125",
      "text": "所谓服务，只是商品或劳动这种使用价值产生的有用效果。",
      "start_ms": 27840,
      "end_ms": 33720,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0126",
      "text": "我们现在考察的却是交换价值。",
      "start_ms": 34840,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    }
  ]
}
